# Purpose: pin the Homebrew installer used only when Homebrew is missing.
# Format: exactly one KEY=VALUE assignment, without spaces, quotes or inline comments.
# Key: HOMEBREW_INSTALL_REF (required, unique).
# Value: a full, lowercase, 40-character Git commit SHA from Homebrew/install.
# Blank lines and lines beginning with # are ignored. Other keys are rejected.
# This is data, not a Shell script: expansions and command substitutions are forbidden.
# Update the commit after reviewing upstream install.sh; never use a branch or tag.
# Example: HOMEBREW_INSTALL_REF=0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef01234567

HOMEBREW_INSTALL_REF=c8188c1d48d77234a458b944d1d1b750f015a1c4
